`tickExitRegionMs` is the last accumulator on `/api/health/exit-cadence` with **no RTH predicate, no boot guard, and a fleet-summed top-level spelling that reads as the criterion**. Found while amending routine `368ce26f` on TRA-2677.

## Measured, 2026-07-30T13:42:30.376Z (build `9e7f1c7`, `startedAt 12:10:15.321Z`, pid 75)

```
books.live.tickExitRegionMs   {samples:   370, maxMs: 10036, atOrAbove20s:   0, atOrAbove30s:  0}
books.demo.tickExitRegionMs   {samples: 10436, maxMs: 67905, atOrAbove20s: 130, atOrAbove30s: 98}
TOP-LEVEL tickExitRegionMs    {samples: 10806, maxMs: 67905, atOrAbove20s: 130, atOrAbove30s: 98}
```

## Three defects, in severity order

